  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country portfolio budget - CPB Nigeria 2019-2023 Support improving the nutrition status of children, PLWG, adolescent girls and other nutritionally vulnerable groups (including people living with HIV) through an integrated malnutrition prevention package, including access to nutritious food and quality care, social behavioural change communication and capacity strengthening</narrative>
